# Normalise line endings so the repo is byte-identical on Windows, macOS, and the
# Linux CI runner. Text files are stored with LF; Git converts on checkout only where
# the platform needs it. Binary artefacts are marked so Git never touches them.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.joblib binary
*.parquet binary
*.zip binary
*.pt binary
*.onnx binary
*.db binary
